WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.620
In 2020, the United States had a
recession that lasted just two months.

2
00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:10.720
After 2008, the UK economy
shrank by more than 6 per cent.

3
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:14.200
It took five years to
get back to its old size.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.930
But in a boom, economies grow fast,

5
00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.100
and jobs are easy to find.

6
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.580
So why do whole economies swing
between good years and bad years?

7
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.730
In this mission, you'll map the
four phases of the economic cycle.

8
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:31.120
Then you'll read quarterly
growth figures and spot exactly

9
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.000
when a recession starts.

10
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.400
Your mission: find out what
drives the ups and downs

11
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.720
of a whole economy.
